Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Read release diffs, requirements, and observed behavior to identify changed semantics, defaults, timing, and error handling. Distinguish internal refactoring from externally meaningful changes even when schemas and type signatures remain compatible.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
